const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文使用深度神经网络、条件信息、宏观状态和无套利准则估计个股资产定价模型。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article estimates an individual-stock asset-pricing model that uses deep neural networks, conditioning information, macroeconomic states, and an economic no-arbitrage criterion. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它以对抗式方法构造信息量高的测试资产并采用柔性条件函数，模型目标、架构、经济约束和时间评估需共同阅读。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses an adversarial construction of informative test assets with flexible conditional functions, so model objective, architecture, economic restriction, and temporal evaluation must be read together. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要历史个股收益、时点一致的公司特征、含发布日期的宏观序列、样本成员、训练验证区间和基准模型定义。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Inputs include historical individual-stock returns, point-in-time firm characteristics, macroeconomic series with release timing, universe membership, training and validation periods, and benchmark-model definitions. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源在其评估设计下报告模型比较，不代表神经网络分数是可投资预测或普适有效的定价核。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source reports model comparisons under its stated evaluation design; it does not establish that a neural-network score is an investable forecast or a universally valid pricing kernel. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"锁定特征可得性和发布时滞；调参时不接触测试期；记录架构、种子、目标和基准；审计退市与缺失；报告制度变化敏感性。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Lock feature availability and release lags; keep the test period untouched during tuning; record architecture, seed, objective, and benchmarks; audit delistings and missing data; and report sensitivity to regime changes. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Management Science · DOI record。经济约束和历史拟合不能消除模型风险、数据泄漏、交易成本，亦不能替代独立复现。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Management Science · DOI record. Economic restrictions and historical fit do not remove model risk, data leakage, transaction costs, or the need for independent replication before any financial use. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1287/mnsc.2023.4695",label:{zh:"Management Science · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Management Science · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Deep Learning in Asset Pricing”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。经济约束和历史拟合不能消除模型风险、数据泄漏、交易成本，亦不能替代独立复现。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Deep Learning in Asset Pricing”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
